<th id="S3.T1.9.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">VisPruner <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al., 2025b</a>)</cite></th>
<td id="S3.T1.9.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">55.40</td>
