<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 11</span>: </span><span id="A2.T11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">POPE performance comparison under 3 settings on Qwen3VL.<span id="A2.T11.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We report accuracy (Acc), F1 scores and Yes-rate. </span></span></figcaption>
